WEBVTT

00:08:58.964 --> 00:09:02.483
are connectivity and entrepreneurship.

00:09:02.483 --> 00:09:04.923
The BRCK is our part

00:09:04.923 --> 00:09:07.507
to keep Africans connected,

00:09:07.507 --> 00:09:11.291
and to help them drive the global digital revolution.

00:09:11.291 --> 00:09:12.505
Thank you.

00:09:12.505 --> 00:09:16.744
(Applause)